DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The iixxll driver supports Intel 700 series controllers based on the Intel
     X710, XXV710, XL710, and X722 Ethernet chipsets.

     The functionality of the Intel 700 series Ethernet controllers has im‐
     proved as newer versions of firmware have been released.  To ensure cor‐
     rect driver operation, apply the most recent (stable) firmware update for
     the network controller.

     The iixxll driver supports querying pluggable transceivers for information
     and diagnostics.  This functionality is available on controllers provid‐
     ing API version 1.6 and higher.

